{"id":"n60884-1-7","stage":4,"title":"불쑥 · 突然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60884-1-7-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 깜짝 놀라?","zh":"怎么这么吃惊啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀라?","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b47d1db3113dea64","term":"깜짝","zh":"一惊","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3","entryId":"37744","definition":"突然间受惊的样子。","pronunciation":["깜짝"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/168a79d7ca6db2156dbf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60884-1-7-2","ko":"네가 갑자기 손을 불쑥 내미니까 그렇지.","zh":"因为你突然伸出手来，所以我才吓一跳的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손을","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불쑥","meaning":"突然","explanation":"불쑥：突然","readings":[{"term":"불쑥","audio":"/audio/d44d0cb67b24a2ae1a3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60884","senseId":"1","lemma":"불쑥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내미니까","meaning":"伸出，探出","explanation":"내밀다：伸出，探出；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"내밀다","audio":"/audio/661313e105db277a6d18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85915","senseId":"1","lemma":"내밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"d44d0cb67b24a2ae","term":"불쑥","zh":"突然","audio":"/audio/d44d0cb67b24a2ae1a3b.mp3","entryId":"60884","definition":"忽然鼓鼓地噌地冒出或伸出的样子。","pronunciation":["불쑥"]},{"id":"661313e105db277a","term":"내밀다","zh":"伸出，探出","audio":"/audio/661313e105db277a6d18.mp3","entryId":"85915","definition":"使身体或物体的一部分朝外或朝前伸展出去。","pronunciation":["내ː밀다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/010225b3167d8caa36e4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60884","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为你突然伸出手来，所以我才吓一跳的。","这里有泉水涌出来哦。","怎么这么吃惊啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为你突然伸出手来，所以我才吓一跳的。","怎么这么吃惊啊？","这里有泉水涌出来哦。"],"answer":0}]}
